  "readmeFile": "README.NuGet.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Switched TabControlDateTimePicker buttons to use svg images, and added a 'Copy to Clipboard' button to go with the import button. Refactored a generic TabControlImageButton out of the ToolbarButton. Removed some unused png assets. Added a new serializer file header id of `SIDE` and replaced the previous object header id with `SCRL`. This is schema breaking and the `ProjectSettings.DataVersion` should be bumped. Fixed DataRepo paths so they no longer change if a generic type element's version changes. Added TaggedException and SerializerException to simplify exception handling. Fixed more DataGrid copying to clipboard not using the same formatting.",
  "repository": "",
